    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3209506904",
      "Source": "Implant of the Primal Desolatitan",
      "Trans": {"SC":"太古荒芜泰坦植入体","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::50875988",
      "Source": "A mysterious implant found in the heart of the Primal Desolatitan. <#RN#><#RN#>It still hums of energy & sounds of a heart beat. I wonder if it still has a use...<#RN#><#RN#>\"_______! _____ __________ __ mtscacinercu ______ ___ ________ ____ ____ ________ ________ : __________ ____!!\"",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在太古荒芜泰坦的心脏中发现的一个神秘植入体。<#RN#><#RN#>它仍在发出能量的嗡鸣和心跳声。我想知道它是否还有用处……<#RN#><#RN#>“_______！_____ __________ __ mtscacinercu ______ ___ ________ ____ ____ ________ ：__ ____！！”","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
