    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1572067754",
      "Source": "Combine various Apex Drops to create this device to summon the Primal Desolatitan Boss for a brutal challenge & huge rewards upon it's defeat.<#RN#><#RN#>WARNING: This Boss is meant to be very difficult. Do not underestimate it. Only Summon if absolutely prepared.<#RN#><#RN#>Note: Crafting costs will change if you have the Arkology: New Encounters Variant Mod installed or not. (Change does not show in engram list)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"组合各种顶级掉落物来制作这个装置，以此召唤荒芜泰坦BOSS，迎接残酷激战，击败后可获取丰厚奖励。<#RN#><#RN#> 警告：该BOSS难度极高，切勿低估它，只有在完全准备就绪后再进行召唤。<#RN#><#RN#> 备注：若安装《New Encounters Variant》变体模组，制作所需材料会发生变动（印痕技能列表不会显示该变动）。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
